  "title": "Vegetable Lo Mein",
  "description": "Whip up a zesty blend of hoisin sauce, honey, soy, ginger, cayenne, and curry powder to flavor this fabulous stir-fry of mushrooms, carrots, peppers, onion, garlic, bean sprouts, and green onion. Toss with hot spaghetti.",
